    <string name="app_mail">Nova Mail</string>
    <string name="mail_sub">Your e-mail – GMX, WEB.DE, Gmail, T-Online and more</string>
    <string name="mail_intro">Sign in with the e-mail account you already have. Nova Mail fetches your mails directly from your provider (IMAP) and sends them over your provider (SMTP) – always encrypted.</string>
    <string name="mail_privacy">Your password stays encrypted on this device (Android keystore) and is only sent to your provider\'s mail server. To find the server settings of unknown addresses, only the domain (e.g. example.com) is looked up in Thunderbird\'s public server list.</string>
